{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L0klMjBUaG91Z2h0JTIwTXklMjBIdXNiYW5kcyUyMFdpZmUlMjBXYXMlMjBEZWFkJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"I Thought My Husbands Wife Was Dead","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7mM2gav7b3REymRSMn5tGMdHu2w.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7ePsYGPG2siNHiAur0fFE2waJPs.jpg","description":"Beautiful wife and expectant mother Lola Winters (Sherilyn Allen) seems to have it all—the big house, a dashing husband Leo Winters (Jamall Johnson), and a thriving restaurant business. But Lola’s seemingly perfect life is interrupted when a ghost from the past Tori (LeToya Luckett) suddenly shows up at her doorstep in search of her husband Leo, after having gone missing for 5 years and being declared dead. Tensions rise and lives are turned upside down as Tori’s unexpected return leaves everyone questioning her motives and why she hasn’t gone to the police. Determined to start a new life, Tori demands that the Winters pay her hundreds of thousands of dollars, but before leaving town a bombshell revelation exposes even more dark and shocking secrets.\n\nReleased 3 Aug 2024 · United States of America · Language: English · 87 min\nStudio: Lifetime\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","TV Movie","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.0","runtime":"87 min","cast":["LeToya Luckett","Sherilyn Allen","Jamall Johnson","Blac Chyna","Max Montesi","Sasha Monica","Shaughnessy O'Brien","Steve Dhillon"],"director":["Troy Scott"],"released":"2024-08-03T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Troy Scott","character":"Director"},{"name":"LeToya Luckett","character":"Tori","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9IgabNj6NtJLwKWOxxT4OOK1JVG.jpg"},{"name":"Sherilyn Allen","character":"Lola Winters","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wlarQPkmTSChX3ErOKUfYxPPzA8.jpg"},{"name":"Jamall Johnson","character":"Leo Winters","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w